= DSBP Congress

Following the unification of liberal and corporatist forces, DSBP now must elect new leader.

The following candidates stand:

• Arthur Mahraun, leader of the Jungdeutsher Order / Jungdo / Young German Order, main beneficiary of this unification.

• Erich Koch Weser, member of the business wing of DDP and one of the unification supporters.

• Otto Thiel, member of the DHV wing of DVP and one of the unification supporters. His candidacy is contested by 

• Baron Rochus von Rheinbaben, leader of the corporatist liberal Front 1929 and main organizer of this unification.

• Friedrich Baltrusch and Georg Streiter, duumvirate representatives of Christian Union Trades within DVP.
